TARGET: lib/package-extensions.js
REASON: validate-npm-package-name is a single-consumer dependency whose only
  used surface here is validForOldPackages/validForNewPackages.  cdxgen carries
  a dependency-free reimplementation at lib/validate-npm-package-name.js so the
  package does not have to be installed; its published engines range is also
  narrower than cdxgen's, which the local copy sidesteps.

---
SEARCH:
import validateName from "validate-npm-package-name";
REPLACE:
import validateName from "./validate-npm-package-name.js";
